EN:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}I was waiting for you,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Don't say anything and just come
with me, please!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Seni şaşırttığımız için kusura bakma.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Aslında bir süredir doğum günü partini
planlıyorduk! {{TAG:0003:0006:}}Hadi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} mumları üfle!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Bir dilek de tut!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Scusa se ti abbiamo spaventat{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
È da un po' che stiamo organizzando
la tua festa di compleanno!
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Beh, lo so che è un giorno in
anticipo, ma quest'anno non
è bisestile{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Ma dai, basta chiacchiere.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Spegni le candeline{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} {{TAG:0003:0026:}}e soprattutto{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
esprimi un desiderio!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}¿A que mola la fiesta sorpresa?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Llevamos un tiempo preparándola.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Además, como este año es bisiesto,
¡por fin podemos celebrar tu cumple
el 29 de febrero!
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}¡Venga,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} pide un deseo{{TAG:0003:0026:}}
y sopla ya esas velas!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Bir dakika, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:000D:}}Bu pastayı
özellikle senin için hazırladık!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Gitmeden önce lütfen mumları üfle!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Désolé, {{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} interdiction de
quitter ma villa avant d'avoir{{TAG:0003:002C:}}
soufflé les bougies !

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Please don't leave yet,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}You gotta blow out the candles!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}That's the only job you have today!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Nicht weggehen, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Du musst doch noch die Kerzen
ausblasen!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}Bitte!

EN:
The three of us worked together to
find the perfect present for you,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

IT:
Noi tre ce l'abbiamo messa tutta
per trovare il regalo perfetto per te,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Espero que tu fiesta de cumpleaños
del año que viene sea así de chula{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
¡Y que te volvamos a sorprender!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

EN:
Now that I think of it,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
you get older, but never look older!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
You always appear so youthful!
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}You must have some secret that
you're not sharing with us! {{TAG:0003:0005:}}I bet it
has to do with your music sense!

ES:
Ahora que lo pienso,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
por muchos años que cumples, 
¡no pareces más viej{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
¿Cuál es tu secreto? {{TAG:0003:0006:}}Deberías
decírmelo, {{TAG:0003:0023:}}prometo no publicarlo
en mi blog.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}

IT:
Ora che ci penso,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
passano gli anni, ma tu non invecchi!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Sembri sempre così giovane!
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Devo prendere esempio da te {{TAG:0003:0023:}}e
cercare di mantenermi giovane
dentro{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ma soprattutto fuori!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}

FR:
« {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0012:0014:}} » {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}J'espère que ton vœu va se réaliser,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}} !
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Je vais en parler à tout le monde,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
y'a peut-être un moyen de faire
quelque chose pour t'aider...

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Te gusta el suspense, ¿eh?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} 
¡Sopla esas velas antes de que
se apaguen, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Die Kerzen brennen ja immer noch...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Na komm schon,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} blas sie endlich
aus!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Ho fatto una torta di compleanno
speciale apposta per te, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Ci ho messo tutto il mio corazón!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Per prima cosa,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} devi esprimere
un desiderio!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Senin için özel bir doğum günü pastası
hazırladım, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Öncelikle{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
bir dilek tutmalısın!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Was? {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Bist du schon fertig?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Also gut,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} warum bläst du dann nicht
die Kerzen aus, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Na los, einfach schön kräftig {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}pusten{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!

FR:
Au fait, {{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}t'as fait quoi
comme vœu ?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Si tu me le dis, {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}je ferai en sorte que
la terre entière le sache,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !
Du coup, ce sera peut-être plus
facile pour toi de le réaliser,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
qu'est-ce que t'en penses ?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
OK, je vais te le dire...
C'est un secret !
